  "rationale": "To clear 22 units of Toned Milk 500ML at risk of expiry, we propose a bundle play with Milk Bread 400G at a bundle price of 201 INR. This play recovers 3135.66 INR (comprising do_nothing_inr of 2771.34 INR plus play_net_inr of 364.32 INR) compared to doing nothing. It also beats a blanket markdown by 3169.32 INR (comprising blanket_markdown_inr of 2805 INR plus play_net_inr of 364.32 INR). The play targets 310 customers after consent filtering, with a 10% holdout. This bundle satisfies the dairy category margin floor of 8.00% and is preferred over markdowns by policy.",
